    "Name": "Pulsar B",
    "Details": "The B configuration of the Pulsar OmniMech is meant for MechWarriors who are more experienced with jump jets, mounting eight improved jump jets to serve as a mobile and accurate harasser. A Large Pulse Laser in the right arm and an LRM-15 launcher with Artemis V in the left arm provide its main firepower, while the remaining tonnage went into a Flamer to discourage infantry. A Nova CEWS covers its electronic warfare.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.07</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
